# held/props/framedrum: the frame drum for the Drum posture (PROPS, P2b; the default and Frame): a pale hide (linen) on a
# wooden rim, held up by the left hand before the chest, struck by the right (hold: on the skin, wave2: the hand raised).
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Anchored on the right shoulder, under the hands.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held framedrum
anchor shoulderR
keys held
z 40

